<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">Employee HSA payroll deduction form</h1>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Return completed forms to:</p>
      <p style="margin: 0;">Company name: <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span></p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Attn: <span data-field="attn_name">{{ attn_name }}</span>, <span data-field="attn_phone">{{ attn_phone }}</span></p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0 0 0;">Email address: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24pt; margin: 0;">LS Lake Shore Savings</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt; margin: 0;">Putting People First.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Annual employer contribution information</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 33.3%;">Self-only</th>
        <th style="width: 33.3%;">Family</th>
        <th style="width: 33.3%;">Other (optional)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: 10pt;">For mid-year enrollees, contact your HR department for your pro-rated employer election amount.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Notes</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">HSA contribution limits and contribution calculator</h3>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Coverage type</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">2021 annual HSA contributions</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Per month</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">2022 annual HSA contributions</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Per month</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Self-only</td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2021_self_only_annual">{{ hsa_2021_self_only_annual }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2021_self_only_monthly">{{ hsa_2021_self_only_monthly }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2022_self_only_annual">{{ hsa_2022_self_only_annual }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2022_self_only_monthly">{{ hsa_2022_self_only_monthly }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Family</td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2021_family_annual">{{ hsa_2021_family_annual }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2021_family_monthly">{{ hsa_2021_family_monthly }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2022_family_annual">{{ hsa_2022_family_annual }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="hsa_2022_family_monthly">{{ hsa_2022_family_monthly }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 60%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <p><strong>Total annual contribution</strong></p>
        <p>Other (Type in amount)</p>
        <p>Total eligible amount</p>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <p><strong>Total annual employer contribution</strong></p>
        <p>Per-pay period max withholding</p>
        <p>Total eligible amount</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 100%; margin-top: 20px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <p>Total annual contribution</p>
        <p>($ <span data-field="total_annual_contribution">{{ total_annual_contribution }}</span>)</p>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <p>Total annual employer contribution</p>
        <p>($ <span data-field="total_employer_contribution">{{ total_employer_contribution }}</span>)</p>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 33%;">
        <p>Total eligible amount</p>
        <p>($ <span data-field="total_eligible_amount">{{ total_eligible_amount }}</span>)</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 20px;">Eligibility and contribution limits to your health savings account (HSA) are determined by the effective date of your high-deductible health plan (HDHP). If you're covered as of December 1, you're considered an eligible individual for the entire year and you're not required to pro-rate your contributions. If you cease to be an eligible individual during the next calendar year, any funding over the prorated amount is considered an excess contribution and subject to a penalty and income tax.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Employee information and authorization</h3>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">
        <p>Employee name: <span data-field="employee_name">{{ employee_name }}</span></p>
        <p>Please withhold $ <span data-field="withhold_amount">{{ withhold_amount }}</span> from my (weekly/bi-weekly/monthly) payroll and apply the funds to my Lakeshore Savings HSA.</p>
        <p>Signature</p>
      </td>
      <td style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
        <p>Last 4 of SSN or employee ID</p>
        <p>Date</p>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>